      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh wow okay that sounds scary. are u sure? i dont have any swelling in my legs or anything like that, i just feel a bit lightheaded. maybe i should just take some advil and rest for a bit and see if it goes away? i really dont want to deal with an er visit right now if it is just stress.",
