      "content": "I understand not wanting to deal with an ER, but lightheadedness plus chest pain and trouble breathing are exactly the warning signs I'm worried about—and leg swelling isn't always present with a clot. Advil won't help if this is a pulmonary embolism, and waiting could be dangerous. Please call emergency services or have someone drive you to the ER now; it's better to be checked and told it's stress than to risk it.",
