      "content": "u seem really certain about this... i mean i did have a lot of caffeine on the plane and i didnt sleep much so i'm pretty jittery. do you really think it's that serious? like, what if it's just gas or indigestion? i've had that happen before when i travel. i just want to feel better without going to a hospital.",
